# ============================================
# Binaries
# ============================================
# These patterns are anchored to the repo root with a leading '/'.
# Without the anchor, gitignore treats `worker` / `server` / `pipelinegen`
# as matching any PATH COMPONENT named that way — which would recursively
# exclude `cmd/worker/`, `cmd/server/`, etc., and all source files under
# them, including new *_test.go (the W1 batch surfaced this regression).
# Anchor it so only the root-level build artifact is ignored.
pipelinegen
/server
/admin
/worker
*.exe
*.dll
*.so

